{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55471","headline":"赠耿郎中 · 王仲简","name":"赠耿郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"得接英贤喜可知，人生能得几多时。\n自从别後颜容改，恰似庭前雨旧碑。\n（见《增修诗话总龟前集》卷三三引《郡阁雅谈》。\n）（按：《郡阁雅谈》云此诗爲仲简卒後其兄仲伟梦庄客持书来附诗。\n仲简与耿振显德中同官，此诗恐系当时作而後人附会入梦者。\n今收录，俟续考。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王仲简","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55471.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55471","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}